Max Slew Violations
-------------------

Found 47 slew violations below the root driver for clock_tree clk_osc_fast_tap4 at (456.410,350.950), in power domain auto-default, which drives a net u_core_fast_phase[4] which is user don't touch with half corner tc_corner:both.late. The worst violation was at the pin u_core_gen_pd_row[5].gen_pd_col[4].u_pd/q1_reg/C with a slew time target of 0.150ns. Achieved a slew time of 0.173ns.



